cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Acoustic Freeform Lab: shaping liquid lenses with sound"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
authors:
  - family-names: Blanco
    given-names: Jhonatan S.
repository-code: "https://github.com/blancusjh/Acoustic-Lens-Shaping-in-Fluids"
abstract: >-
  Theory, numerical model and design tool for forming stigmatic singlet lenses
  from a UV-curable liquid between two water layers by acoustic radiation
  stress, with one fixed machine selecting the lens through its drive command.
  Numerical model only; nothing has been built or measured.
keywords:
  - acoustofluidics
  - acoustic radiation stress
  - liquid lens
  - stigmatic singlet
  - semidefinite programming
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Silva-Lora
        given-names: Alberto
      - family-names: Torres
        given-names: Rafael
    title: "Superconical aplanatic ovoid singlet lenses"
    journal: "Journal of the Optical Society of America A"
    volume: 37
    issue: 7
    start: 1155
    end: 1165
    year: 2020
    doi: "10.1364/JOSAA.392795"
